<div class="am2w">
  <div class="am2w__wrap">
    <div class="am2w__head">
      <span class="am2w__eyebrow">The AM2Luxe difference</span>
      <h2 class="am2w__title">Two ways to wear</h2>
      <p class="am2w__sub">Every set arrives with both, so the wear suits your week.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="am2w__grid">
      <div class="am2w__col">
        <div class="am2w__k">I</div><div class="am2w__kl">Glue</div>
        <h3 class="am2w__h">Set it and forget it</h3>
        <div class="am2w__dur">Seven to fourteen days</div>
        <p class="am2w__p">For events, travel, and weeks you want a flawless manicure that stays put. Apply with the included glue and go.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="am2w__col">
        <div class="am2w__k">II</div><div class="am2w__kl">Tabs</div>
        <h3 class="am2w__h">On, off, and back on</h3>
        <div class="am2w__dur">Three to five days</div>
        <p class="am2w__p">Sticky tabs let you lift your nails off and reuse them. Gentle on your natural nails, made for switching looks.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="am2w__note">Lift them off for the <em>game</em>, and set them right back after.<br>Nails made to keep up with a full life.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .am2w{background:#161311;color:#F5F1E8}
  .am2w__wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:92px 34px}
  .am2w__head{text-align:center;max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 46px}
  .am2w__eyebrow{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.34em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C4A968}
  .am2w__title{font-family:'Bodoni Moda',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:48px;color:#F5F1E8;margin:14px 0 12px}
  .am2w__sub{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:15px;color:rgba(245,241,232,.6)}
  .am2w__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border:1px solid rgba(196,169,104,.4)}
  .am2w__col{padding:50px 44px}
  .am2w__col:first-child{border-right:1px solid rgba(196,169,104,.4)}
  .am2w__k{font-family:'Bodoni Moda',serif;font-size:26px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8A6D2F,#F4E7B8,#A8874A);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;color:transparent}
  .am2w__kl{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(245,241,232,.55);margin-top:2px}
  .am2w__h{font-family:'Bodoni Moda',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:31px;color:#F5F1E8;margin:16px 0 6px}
  .am2w__dur{font-family:'Bodoni Moda',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px;color:#C4A968;margin-bottom:18px}
  .am2w__p{font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:rgba(245,241,232,.75)}
  .am2w__note{text-align:center;margin:44px 0 0;font-family:'Bodoni Moda',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:26px;line-height:1.5;color:#F5F1E8}
  .am2w__note em{color:#C4A968}
  @media(max-width:800px){.am2w__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.am2w__col:first-child{border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(196,169,104,.4)}.am2w__title{font-size:38px}}
</style>
